==Battleground==
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*50 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*50 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*50 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 1~3 seconds<sup>30f~90f</sup>.
*5 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[H. Nah]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Wavers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] can be used to clear the horde of Trolly Bloggers. Easter B.B.Bunnies and H. Nahs can be dealt with using Midrange Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], Lucky Sloths might look threatening but they don't do much until all supporting enemies are defeat, by which it can be dealt with by using long range units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]].

